00:05:47.508 --> 00:05:48.341
- How are you?

00:05:48.341 --> 00:05:49.174
- Hi Gary.

00:05:49.174 --> 00:05:50.007
- How are you?

00:05:50.007 --> 00:05:50.840
- Good to see you today.

00:05:50.840 --> 00:05:51.673
- Great to see you.

00:05:51.673 --> 00:05:53.449
- So I am actually in the
Facebook marketing business

00:05:53.449 --> 00:05:54.913
and sometimes my clients,

00:05:54.913 --> 00:05:56.197
they say something around,

00:05:56.197 --> 00:05:58.602
they don't want to market
themselves too much --

00:05:58.602 --> 00:06:00.317
- Personally?

00:06:00.317 --> 00:06:02.597
- Yeah personally, maybe
they're like therapists

00:06:02.597 --> 00:06:04.350
or they run some causes or whatever and --

00:06:04.350 --> 00:06:05.467
- Or ugly.

00:06:05.467 --> 00:06:06.300
- Uh. (nervous chuckle)

00:06:06.300 --> 00:06:07.598
- I'm kidding, I'm kidding,
I'm kidding, I'm kidding.

00:06:07.598 --> 00:06:08.684
Go ahead, go ahead.
- I hope not.

00:06:08.684 --> 00:06:11.053
- But sometimes people have this feeling

00:06:11.053 --> 00:06:12.372
that they don't want to --

00:06:12.372 --> 00:06:13.205
- Yes.

00:06:13.205 --> 00:06:14.088
- Be too much in other people's face.

00:06:14.088 --> 00:06:14.921
- Yes.

00:06:14.921 --> 00:06:17.174
- Do you have advice for that situation?

00:06:17.174 --> 00:06:18.204
- I would tell you

00:06:18.204 --> 00:06:20.652
that you should not convince them of that.

00:06:20.652 --> 00:06:22.364
Because I'm so out there,

00:06:22.364 --> 00:06:23.612
people are always like,

00:06:23.612 --> 00:06:26.004
okay, should I build a
personal brand for my business?

00:06:26.004 --> 00:06:28.405
You know, should I be in their feed

00:06:28.405 --> 00:06:29.628
five times a day, every day?

00:06:29.628 --> 00:06:33.760
I think the answer is,
not necessarily, right?

00:06:33.760 --> 00:06:35.073
I think to me,

00:06:35.073 --> 00:06:37.752
I think it's reverse
engineering the individual.

00:06:37.752 --> 00:06:41.039
You know now, if your
business is selling yourself,

00:06:41.039 --> 00:06:43.106
as a fitness instructor or a lawyer

00:06:43.106 --> 00:06:46.270
or a financial investor
or a real estate agent,

00:06:46.270 --> 00:06:48.639
you're gonna wanna be out there, right?

00:06:48.639 --> 00:06:50.463
And if the question is more

00:06:50.463 --> 00:06:54.432
about the difference
between alpha American DNA

00:06:54.432 --> 00:06:56.851
where you're out in front
and other parts of the world

00:06:56.851 --> 00:06:58.563
where people are more reserved,

00:06:58.563 --> 00:07:00.842
you know, at some level
it's very difficult

00:07:00.842 --> 00:07:02.861
to make somebody do something
they're not comfortable with.

00:07:02.861 --> 00:07:04.549
They'll never be good at it.

00:07:04.549 --> 00:07:06.362
I wanna remind everybody,

00:07:06.362 --> 00:07:07.935
some of the biggest
companies in the world,

00:07:07.935 --> 00:07:10.393
you don't even know the name of the CEO,

00:07:10.393 --> 00:07:12.899
let alone what she or he looks like.

00:07:12.899 --> 00:07:15.695
So, just because there are
certain people taking advantage,

00:07:15.695 --> 00:07:18.279
and others of the opportunity,

00:07:18.279 --> 00:07:21.277
building personal brand
as a branding mechanism

00:07:21.277 --> 00:07:22.300
to build their business,

00:07:22.300 --> 00:07:25.046
it doesn't mean it's
the only way to do it.

00:07:25.046 --> 00:07:27.488
And so I never try to convince people

00:07:27.488 --> 00:07:31.556
to build their personal
brand or be out there more.

00:07:31.556 --> 00:07:34.592
I remind them that if they're
good at it and enjoy it,

00:07:34.592 --> 00:07:38.092
is it a credibly owned and controllable IP

00:07:39.569 --> 00:07:42.069
that is unbelievably scalable,

00:07:43.248 --> 00:07:45.121
but I would tell you that I don't think

00:07:45.121 --> 00:07:48.971
that this is a one size fits
all situation and environment.

00:07:48.971 --> 00:07:51.938
And so I'm not overly passionate

00:07:51.938 --> 00:07:54.718
that everybody needs to
build their personal brand,

00:07:54.718 --> 00:07:58.301
but there is significant
upside if you can.

00:08:00.254 --> 00:08:01.087
Cool.

00:08:01.087 --> 00:08:03.337
(applause)

00:08:06.313 --> 00:08:08.480
- [Host] Vitvas, upstairs?

00:08:09.799 --> 00:08:10.632
- Very nice.

00:08:10.632 --> 00:08:12.257
