00:32:52.644 --> 00:32:56.146
that the ROI of you giving it
to them for free for the photo

00:32:56.146 --> 00:32:59.479
is worth it for you from
a business standpoint.

00:32:59.479 --> 00:33:03.082
So I would say those three and then look,

00:33:03.082 --> 00:33:04.366
it's very abstract

00:33:04.366 --> 00:33:06.417
to say you're gonna do
Facebook and Google.

00:33:06.417 --> 00:33:09.332
Really understanding the
content that you need to make

00:33:09.332 --> 00:33:12.800
in a Facebook environment
is incredibly important.

00:33:12.800 --> 00:33:15.925
So you can waste $10,000 on
Facebook in a month very quickly

00:33:15.925 --> 00:33:18.094
if you don't know what you're doing.

00:33:18.094 --> 00:33:19.859
And so, just make sure

00:33:19.859 --> 00:33:21.587
