that people wanna watch.

00:34:17.179 --> 00:34:19.748
So, yes, I believe it,

00:34:19.748 --> 00:34:21.823
but can you and can he and can others

00:34:21.823 --> 00:34:23.283
make a great --

00:34:23.283 --> 00:34:24.116
