00:34:49.024 --> 00:34:50.302
I believe that everybody here

00:34:50.302 --> 00:34:52.720
can hire two to three
incredible, creative interns,

00:34:52.720 --> 00:34:54.665
pay them very little,

00:34:54.665 --> 00:34:58.293
