00:38:15.827 --> 00:38:19.674
And it's so hard and so
lonely and exposes you so much

00:38:19.674 --> 00:38:21.686
that I want people in the right mindset.

00:38:21.686 --> 00:38:24.320
So there's no tactic I do every day

00:38:24.320 --> 00:38:27.320
other than consume and listen.

00:38:27.320 --> 00:38:28.447
I read my email.

00:38:28.447 --> 00:38:30.170
